---
title: "Manifestation via Synthesis"
scope: feature
phase: 1
feature: 1
---
flowchart TB
    subgraph inquiry["Phase 1a — Inquiry (unchanged)"]
        Q[Senses ask questions] --> A[Parsifal answers]
        A --> FU{Follow-ups?}
        FU -->|yes| Q
        FU -->|no| IC[Inquiry context locked]
    end

    subgraph synthesis["Phase 1b — Synthesis Loop (new)"]
        direction TB
        SM["Each sense manifests<br/><i>What does the finished thing<br/>look like from my perspective?</i>"]
        SY["Synthesizer combines<br/>into unified vision<br/><i>Tensions named & resolved,<br/>not smoothed over</i>"]
        SE["Each sense evaluates<br/><i>Does this capture what I said?<br/>Are tension resolutions acceptable?<br/>Am I satisfied?</i>"]
        CHECK{All senses<br/>satisfied?}

        SM --> SY
        SY --> SE
        SE --> CHECK
        CHECK -->|"unresolved tensions"| SY
    end

    subgraph approval["Phase 1c — Approval (unchanged)"]
        direction TB
        SHOW["Present vision to Parsifal<br/><i>Per-sense contributions visible<br/>Resolved tensions flagged</i>"]
        DECIDE{Parsifal says?}
        SHOW --> DECIDE
    end

    IC --> SM
    CHECK -->|"all satisfied"| SHOW
    DECIDE -->|"redirect + feedback"| SE
    DECIDE -->|"accepted"| MF

    MF["Manifested Future locked<br/><i>Constraint surface, not artifact.<br/>The senses are the checklist.</i>"]
    MF --> PATH["Phase B — Path Reasoning<br/><i>Backward from the vision</i>"]

    style inquiry fill:#2d3436,stroke:#636e72,color:#dfe6e9
    style synthesis fill:#1e3a5f,stroke:#74b9ff,color:#dfe6e9
    style approval fill:#2d3436,stroke:#636e72,color:#dfe6e9
    style MF fill:#0a3d2e,stroke:#00b894,color:#dfe6e9
    style PATH fill:#2d3436,stroke:#636e72,color:#dfe6e9,stroke-dasharray: 5 5
